  "solution": "<ul><li>Tìm số trung bình của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm.<br>Ta có bảng thống kê điện lượng của pin theo giá trị đại diện là:\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tex-center\"><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table class=\"tex-table\"><tbody><tr><td><strong>Điện lượng</strong></td></tr><tr><td><strong>(nghìn mAh)</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Giá trị đại diện</strong></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>925</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>975</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>025</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>075</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>125</mn></mrow></semantics></math></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Số viên pin</strong></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>10</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>20</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>35</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>15</mn></semantics></math></td><td><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>5</mn></semantics></math></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\n\t\t\tSố trung bình của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm theo dõi điện lượng của một số viên pin xấp xỉ bằng: <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>925</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>975</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>025</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>075</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>125</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>016</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Tìm mốt của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm.<br>Nhóm chứa mốt của mẫu số liệu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>35</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>u</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Mốt của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>35</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>15</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>143</mn><mn>140</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>021</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li><li>Tìm các tứ phân vị của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>…</mi></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>85</mn></msub></semantics></math> là mẫu số liệu được xếp theo thứ tự không giảm.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>10</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>11</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>30</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>31</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>65</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>66</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>80</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>; <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>81</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>85</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>15</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tứ phân vị thứ nhất của mẫu số liệu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>22</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên tứ phân vị thứ nhất của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>85</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mn>20</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>95</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>313</mn><mn>320</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>978</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTứ phân vị thứ hai của mẫu số liệu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>43</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên tứ phân vị thứ hai của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>85</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>57</mn><mn>56</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>018</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tTứ phân vị thứ ba của mẫu số liệu là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>64</mn></msub><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> nên tứ phân vị thứ ba của mẫu số liệu ghép nhóm là \n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>85</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>35</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>05</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>587</mn><mn>560</mn></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>048</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div></li></ul>",
